Bw2xw1mjT7zmUTbcirwrXdUqMDeobHA&oe=6B0C734A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "gravitylab_2020-07-13_19-40-18.png", "id": "2762335540653496", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031640_2762335543986829_5936103490408270971_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sIezQ7CTZsYQ7kNvwHhhp9f&_nc_oc=Adqmalyltyp-q9xeAb7vKS12J8utjJxqBQ5GGN4RDwhEUj2KZ360-u0eGs0EBTniA20&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR0o2eeEd_K0gacbGzjVN9YlZyhGL9w-eypKwHrzwnZiQ&oe=6B0C66BE"}, "display_name": "Gravity Lab", "keywords": ["physics", "puzzle", "lab", "machine", "gravity"], "long_description": "Build Your Incredible Machine - Gravity Lab would like to introduce our new range of gravity modifying appliances!\n\nNo matter how fast or how heavy your objects are, we can move them! Save money and time by replacing your entire human workforce with automated appliances from Gravity Lab. Currently awaiting regulatory approval, we invite you to visit our testing facility and give them a go! We have prepared a selection of test scenarios for you and we are certain you can solve them!\nAlso feel free to create your own test scenario and share them with fellow participants!\n\nPlease be aware that strong gravitational forces can cause a looming feeling of being observed! Never look directly at the emitted particles! While we tried our best to avoid the creation of micro wormholes, please never try to stack gravitational objects. All damages to the time and space continuum and all involved repair costs will be passed on to you!\n-- Gravity Lab Management", "short_description": "Build Your Incredible Machine - Gravity Lab would like to introduce our new range of gravity modifying appliances! Our smartest chimpanzees couldn't solve some of our testing scenarios, but we are confident that you can!"}]}, "developer_name": "Mark Schramm", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://gravitation